Package: OmicsFlow
Type: Package
Title: Multi-Omics Integration and Survival Analysis Framework
Version: 2.0.1
Authors@R: person("Abdullah Ibrahim", "Ali",
    email = "abdullah@omicsflow.dev",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A modular multi-omics analysis framework supporting RNA-seq,
    DNA methylation, CNV, and SNV data. Provides automated metadata
    abstraction, dynamic modality-aware validation, MOFA+ integration,
    machine learning survival modeling, pathway enrichment, and
    publication-quality HTML reporting. Designed for RStudio-first
    workflows with flexible cohort support.
